### H2: When You Search Affects What You Find

**Writing instruction:** This section covers rental market seasonality in NYC. State the peak season (June through September) and its practical effects: faster decisions required (24-48 hours after showing), more competition, less room to negotiate. State the slower season (October through February) and its advantages: more negotiating leverage, longer decision windows, lower effective rents in some cases. Keep this to 150-200 words. Do not overstate the off-season advantage; be honest that inventory is also thinner in winter.

